From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: expose Group accessible root

Give the GTK4 Group view a stable accessible name and group role while keeping
its existing friend model and empty-state behavior unchanged.

--- a/src/jarabe/desktop/groupbox.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/desktop/groupbox.py
@@ -43,1 +43,3 @@
         self.set_focusable(False)
+        self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL],
+                             [_('Group')])
+        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
